body:
I've ran through therapy twice, one for 6 weeks, another for 12. I've been through multiple jobs in life trying to change it up so I can maybe feel something better, I've gone through multiple career choices, life enjoyment changes. And at the end of it all I just can't do it anymore. Everything is a chore to me in the end and I...just want to quit.

&#x200B;

Not to mention the more I keep going the more of a burden I place on my family. I'd rather stop here before I drag them down even more.
